{
  "feature": "B19 · Search palette, notifications panel and their states",
  "note": "Plan row B19 of docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-11-bplus-redesign.md. Boards (design/design_handoff_bplus_redesign/screens/): palette = 07-more-screens/more-r3-palette, 07-more-screens/more-r3-search_m; palette-no-results = 06-states/bp-s-empty_search_m; search-page = 07-more-screens/more-r3-search_m; notifications = 06-states/bp-s-notif_m, 06-states/bp-s-notif_empty_m. Walk by hand on staging (no kit verb reaches them yet): palette-typed (07-more-screens/more-r3-palette_typed, 07-more-screens/more-r3-search_m_typed): results carry no selector the page behind cannot also match; notif-states (06-states/bp-s-notif_load_m, 06-states/bp-s-notif_error_m).",
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "palette",
      "label": "/events: search palette open",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/events",
          "wait": "[data-testid=\"event-row\"]"
        },
        {
          "click": "header button[aria-label=\"Search\"]:visible",
          "wait": "input[placeholder=\"Search artists or venues…\"]",
          "settle": 300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "palette-no-results",
      "label": "/events: palette typed, no results",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/events",
          "wait": "[data-testid=\"event-row\"]"
        },
        {
          "click": "header button[aria-label=\"Search\"]:visible",
          "wait": "input[placeholder=\"Search artists or venues…\"]"
        },
        {
          "fill": "input[placeholder=\"Search artists or venues…\"]",
          "text": "zzqx-contact-sheet",
          "wait": "text=No results for \"zzqx-contact-sheet\"."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "search-page",
      "label": "/search",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/search",
          "wait": "input[placeholder=\"Search artists, venues…\"]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "notifications",
      "label": "/events: account menu, Notifications",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/events",
          "wait": "[data-testid=\"event-row\"]"
        },
        {
          "click": "button[aria-label^=\"Account menu\"]:visible",
          "wait": "[role=\"dialog\"]"
        },
        {
          "clickRole": "button",
          "name": "^Notifications",
          "wait": "[role=\"dialog\"]:has-text(\"What you missed\")",
          "settle": 400
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
